Node ID=1 the heir challenges you
Text=Far enough. <The bows around him are not the Khan's bows -- too red, too many, and not one of them pointed at the floor.> I am Hrargrub. My Khan was Butu. You have heard of Plumjum. Nobody has heard of Butu. That is the whole of my complaint and you are standing in the middle of it.
