Node ID=20 you emptied the chair
Text=<Something goes out of him, and what comes back is worse: a goblin with nothing left to be angry about.> You emptied the chair. I am standing in it. I had six winters of reasons and you did it in an afternoon, which I will think about later and not in front of you.
