Node ID=60 who was butu
Text=Nobody. That is the answer and that is the grievance. He was Khan before Plumjum was anything, and he wrote poems, and Plumjum has the book of them on the floor of his cave with the rest of his shiny. He has drawn plans for six winters. Have you seen the plans? They are very good plans.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What do you want from me?
Go to node ID=90 the book
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have heard enough.
Go to node ID=80 go then
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=90 the book
Text=My Khan's poems. Plumjum keeps the book in the Warrens with his gold, and he does not know what it is, and the humans in the city buy such things by weight. Bring it to me and this cave is yours to walk through.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Has Butu Khan Poetry Book
Reply Text=I have it here.
Go to node ID=100 the book returned
